    "active": true,
    "description": "<p><strong>RYUKARI</strong></p>\n<p><em>The heat within your body has intensified until ordinary flame feels little different from the warmth of a forge.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Zenki Heritage, Level 5</p>\n<p>You gain resistance to fire. Furthermore, the racial bonus granted by your Zenki heritage to Crafting checks involving metal, stone or a forge increases from +1 to +2.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> resistance to fire, and the Zenki heritage's own Crafting tick (metal, stone or a forge) becomes +2 instead of +1 while you have this feat; removing the feat puts it back.</p>",
